  "id": "self-management-therapy",
  "term": "self-management therapy",
  "definition": "Self-management therapy is described here as a brief, low-intensity therapeutic approach that can be used across different kinds of problems rather than for only one diagnosis. In this context, it is intended to improve health in people with chronic pelvic pain that has not responded to medical treatment and may also lessen social, economic, and health-care burden.",
